````

Now to properly run Swag, use this command:

```bash
# Run swag init with the proper options
swag init --parseDependency --generalInfo cmd/api/main.go
```

The `--parseDependency` flag is important as it tells Swag to parse dependencies across packages, which will help it find model definitions.

You might also need to create similar Swagger model definitions in other handler files that are referenced in the error message, such as the auth.go file.

